{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Assurance of the Resurrection"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we know that if our earthly "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Physical body"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "house, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tent, is destroyed, we have a building from God, a house not made with hands, eternal in the heavens. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in this we groan, earnestly desiring to be clothed with our "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "dwelling"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "habitation which is from heaven, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if indeed, having been clothed, we shall not be found naked. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we who are in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tent groan, being burdened, not because we want to be unclothed, but further clothed, that mortality may be swallowed up by life. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now He who has prepared us for this very thing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God, who also has given us the Spirit as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "down payment, earnest"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a guarantee."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " always confident, knowing that while we are at home in the body we are absent from the Lord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we walk by faith, not by sight. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We are confident, yes, well pleased rather to be absent from the body and to be present with the Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Judgment Seat of Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore we make it our aim, whether present or absent, to be well pleasing to Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we must all appear before the judgment seat of Christ, that each one may receive the things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "done"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the body, according to what he has done, whether good or bad. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Knowing, therefore, the terror of the Lord, we persuade men; but we are well known to God, and I also trust are well known in your consciences."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Be Reconciled to God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we do not commend ourselves again to you, but give you opportunity to boast on our behalf, that you may have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "an answer"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for those who boast in appearance and not in heart. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if we are beside ourselves, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for God; or if we are of sound mind, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the love of Christ compels us, because we judge thus: that if One died for all, then all died; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and He died for all, that those who live should live no longer for themselves, but for Him who died for them and rose again."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, from now on, we regard no one according to the flesh. Even though we have known Christ according to the flesh, yet now we know "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him thus"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no longer. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, if anyone "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Christ, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "he is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a new creation; old things have passed away; behold, all things have become new. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now all things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of God, who has reconciled us to Himself through Jesus Christ, and has given us the ministry of reconciliation, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that is, that God was in Christ reconciling the world to Himself, not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "reckoning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "imputing their trespasses to them, and has committed to us the word of reconciliation."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now then, we are ambassadors for Christ, as though God were pleading through us: we implore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on Christ’s behalf, be reconciled to God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He made Him who knew no sin "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sin for us, that we might become the righteousness of God in Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}